repository agree on 34 of 34 code lines, with exactly one line differing.

Adapted files:
  src/compaction/drop-failed-assistant-turns.ts   (the port itself)
  src/compaction/compaction.ts                    (call site)
  src/compaction/index.ts                         (barrel re-export)

Adaptations, in order of how widely they apply:

  1. Location: upstream keeps this helper at
     `packages/ai/src/utils/drop-failed-assistant-turns.ts`. Here it lives in
     `packages/agent/src/compaction/` and is re-exported through the compaction
     barrel, because its only consumer is the compaction entry point.
  2. Docblock: upstream's comment cites paths and lanes from its own tree
     (`api/transform-messages.ts`, the claude-sdk-oauth prompt bridge, cursor
     turns). Those were replaced with this repository's equivalent seams
     (`buildSessionContext()`, `convertToLlm`); the upstream reasoning is kept.
     The provenance paragraph above was added.
  3. Formatting: oxfmt is the only formatter here, so `filter((message) => ...)`
     is normalized to `filter(message => ...)`. This is the single differing
     line, and it has no effect on behaviour.

No behavioral change was made to the ported code.

